acceptance_criteria: Move preserves FileId while copy mints a new FileId with an auditable source edge; pm vcs items files changes and trace answer PM attribution from immutable commits plus PM history; pm vcs commit --item validates the PM item and records an explicit association without editing the item; Two-agent branch merges retain attribution for different linked files and deleted files remain historically traceable; Sparse or incomplete history reports required missing fragments instead of an incomplete answer
